{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超，出席國際基建卓越周2026開幕典禮及第二屆國際基建項目領導峰會。<br/>\n<br/>\n他致辭時說，國家「十五五」規劃提出要鞏固提升建築業在全球的地位與競爭力，香港具備優勢作出貢獻，將國家實力與國際機遇對接，將機遇轉化為成功項目。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:04:06.149203+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:49:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:57:22.734692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:57:22.686407+00:00","content_hash":"a0ccc9d72f41a21a5a8f5dd509a53d75baa1f43c1000d03150b194f94fe7e64c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}